/// Aged debt snapshot records for property tenancies - one row per tenancy per charge type per monthly snapshot ('As At Date'). Each row holds the outstanding balance split into ageing buckets (Current 0-6 ... 91+ days) plus payment-recency flags. Related to 'Tenancy' via the business key 'Property Tenancy ID'; property attributes are reached indirectly through Tenancy (the 'Property ID' column here is NOT an active relationship).
